      "created_at": "2025-09-09T05:47:43.565Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/majid_farhan\">@Majid_Farhan</a></p>\n<p>Since supplier is SAVE doctype where disable chech box can be updated  automatically within your workflow untill it reaches to Approved state.</p>\n<p>By default you have to mark disable check box ON and read only whick then workflow will update later under workflow automatically.</p>\n<p>The further control can be configured by applying filter on supplier link field within PO / Supplier Quotation doctypes to list out only enabled supplier which you have already approved under workflow.</p>",
